<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Centocor price target lifted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Centocor price target lifted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its price target for Centocor Inc to $51 from its previous target of $40 to $45 on Tuesday. The stock rating was reiterated at strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares jumped 1-3/4 to 30-3/4 at the opening on Tuesday.</p>
